<td style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; WIDTH: 18pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; align: right">(1)</td>
<td style="WIDTH: auto; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; TEXT-ALIGN: justify">
<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'">The Sales Charge is subject to waivers for certain types of investors.&#160; Any amounts paid by a Member as a Sales Charge will not be part of such Member&#8217;s investment in the Feeder Fund.&#160; See &#8220;Subscription for Units.&#8221;</div>
