<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'">All figures shown here are hypothetical.&#160; In actual fact, as of April 30, 2019, the Feeder Fund held approximately 54.6% of the Master Fund&#8217;s units, which means that if no Master Fund Members tendered their Units in that fund&#8217;s June 30, 2019 tender offer, the Feeder Fund would have been able to repurchase approximately 36.6% of its Units outstanding.</div>
