<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt">The Annual Net Performance shown above is net of all fund level expenses, including interest expense (including loan commitment fees), custody fees, bank charges, other expenses, an annual advisory fee of 1.20% and the annual account servicing fee of 0.75% applied monthly.&#160; Other expenses are calculated at 0.25% per annum, which represents the maximum amount of other expenses that could be charged to the Feeder Fund due to the Expense Limitation Agreement.&#160; Actual other expenses may be lower than 0.25% per annum.</div>

