<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt">Subject to the general oversight of the Board and in accordance with the investment objective, policies and restrictions of the Fund, Ironwood provides the Fund with ongoing investment guidance, policy direction and monitoring of the Fund pursuant to the Investment Management Agreement.</div>

