<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt">In consideration for these services (and certain services relating to the Feeder Fund), the Master Fund pays the Fund Administrator a monthly administrative fee.</div>

