<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt">The Distributor is not affiliated with Ironwood, the Fund Administrator, the Custodian or the Regulatory Compliance Consultant.</div>

<div>&#160;</div>

<div style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt">Pursuant to a related Distribution Services Agreement, the Master Fund pays the Distributor certain fees for providing distribution services to the Master Fund and the Feeder Fund and reimburses certain expenses incurred by the Distributor in connection with the registration of the Feeder Fund&#8217;s and the Master Fund&#8217;s units for sale.&#160; There is a fee paid monthly to the Distributor based on the Master Fund&#8217;s net asset value.&#160; For the fiscal year ended April 30, 2019 those monthly fees aggregated $114,430. In addition to a maximum Sales Charge of 3.0%, the maximum amount of items of compensation payable to the Distributor under the Distribution Services Agreement, including the reimbursement of out-of-pocket expenses, will not exceed 2.65% of the gross offering proceeds of the Fund.</div>

